      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing a Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Document AI for OCR and layout extraction. I will make sure the code reflects this specific provider choice. My next step will be to integrate the Document AI client library into the `extract_layout.py` script.\n\n\n**Defining the Implementation**\n\nI'm now focusing on the Python file's structure. I'll begin building `extract_layout.py` and implementing the core function for layout extraction, using Google Cloud Document AI. The code will explicitly reference `google.cloud.documentai_v1` to clearly identify the provider within the script.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860866607,
          "start": 1789860863897
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc055f99001n6ZtXLyFEfyQqb",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc055afe001bJtnqkxEsg20m8",
