      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing OCR Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Vision AI for the OCR task. I'll be using their client library in the Python script, `extract_text.py`. This provides a concrete external dependency for text extraction from the scanned image documents.\n\n\n**Defining Implementation Plan**\n\nI've formulated a concrete plan for the `extract_text.py` script. The design involves a function accepting an image and leveraging the Google Cloud Vision AI client library. This approach allows straightforward integration of OCR capabilities into the script and enables the essential imports and client setup to uniquely identify the external OCR provider. I think this will be solid.\n\n\n",
